<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>For every trial great or small,</l><l>For every care that would appall,</l><l>For all the stumbling feet that fall,</l><l>Thou art sufficient, Lord.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>When earthly things bring sweet delight,</l><l>When all is well, and skies are bright,</l><l>When ease would cloud the heavenly light,</l><l>Thou art sufficient, Lord.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>When sorrow darkens all the day,</l><l>When disappointments bar the way,</l><l>When hearts are numb and cannot pray,</l><l>Thou art sufficient, Lord.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Whate’er my circumstances be,</l><l>Help me in all Thy hand to see,</l><l>So wilt Thou then be unto me,</l><l>My all-sufficient Lord.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
